WEBVTT

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:10.292
I like your boots.

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:16.125
I... I really like your socks.

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.625
Do you like my beard, madame?

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.957
Very impressive, m'lady.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:27.666
Yes, I'm one billion years old.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.750
That's why it's so glorious.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.542
[Bonnie and Blaze laughing]

00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:38.707
Um...

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.375
Do you wanna play?

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:41.917
[gasps]

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.792
Okay.

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:46.207
- Walter, let's go.
- Okay. Okay.

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:48.082
- Do you actually have a horse?
- Yeah.

00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:49.582
[Bonnie] Like, a real one?

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:51.250
[Blaze laughs] Yes! It's real.

00:00:53.917 --> 00:00:56.416
[gasps] Hey, I have an idea.

00:00:56.417 --> 00:00:57.875
[♪ ceremonial music plays]

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.333
[chattering]

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:05.457
- [door opens]
- [gasping]

00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:06.874
[gasping, clamoring]

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:08.542
[Dolly] Look at that kilt.

00:01:10.042 --> 00:01:11.250
[gasps]

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:16.292
[blusters, cries]

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.207
[sniffling]

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:21.792
Please, take care of my son.

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:26.707
[clears throat]

00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:29.791
Friends, we are gathered here today

00:01:29.792 --> 00:01:33.124
to witness the most wonderfulest union

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:34.541
of Sheriff Jessie

00:01:34.542 --> 00:01:37.291
and Buzz-tholomew MacLightyear.

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:39.042
- [creaks]
- [beeping]

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:46.624
Now, Sheriff,

00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:50.499
please put this ring
onto Buzz's itty-bitty finger

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.375
and make your vows.

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:56.374
Buzz, will you take this ring

00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:58.082
as my pinky promise

00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:01.124
to have fun, and play with you and stuff,

00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:03.082
for all my days,

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:05.124
even the hard ones?

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.125
- I do--
- [Bonnie's mom] <i>Bonnie...</i>

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.291
have you seen my wedding ring?

00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:10.207
- [gasps]
- [giggles]

00:02:10.208 --> 00:02:11.582
- [giggles]
- [shushes] Uh...

00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:13.624
Maybe check the bathroom?

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:14.999
Wait, wait, wait. We need, like...

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.249
Flowers! From the garden.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.750
- Good idea.
- Follow me.

00:02:18.417 --> 00:02:20.500
And there's confetti in the craft drawer.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:22.957
Oh, congrats, you two.

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:24.457
Don't worry. I took plenty of photos

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:25.624
for Smarty and the gang.

00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:28.417
That's really sweet of you, Lily.

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:29.957
[chuckles]

00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:31.042
Mmm.

00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:33.042
You done good, Sheriff.

00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:35.750
You can call me Jessica.

00:02:36.292 --> 00:02:37.917
Okay, I will. Jessica.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.082
Actually, no. No.

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.166
Okay.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:42.332
[beeping]

00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:43.666
Hey, when you get a chance,

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:46.124
can you introduce me to the ring bearer?

00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:47.791
- Oh.
- Awooga.

00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:48.916
Okay.

00:02:48.917 --> 00:02:50.083
[gasps] They're coming.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.374
I got it. That's awesome.

00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:53.832
That's such a good idea.

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:55.707
The wedding is on.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:56.791
Okay!

00:02:56.792 --> 00:02:58.207
- [Bonnie] Buzz...
- Buzz,

00:02:58.208 --> 00:03:01.249
do you take me as
your super cool, sheriff wife?

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.624
I do.

00:03:02.625 --> 00:03:04.124
And do you take me as your handsome,

00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:06.375
Space Ranger husband?

00:03:06.917 --> 00:03:08.500
- Oh.
- [gasps]

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.500
I do.

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:13.249
Then I now pronounce you--

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.166
I object!

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.167
Oh, no.

00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:18.957
Buzz is already married...

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.082
to me!

00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:21.457
[♪ dramatic music plays]

00:03:21.458 --> 00:03:22.375
[gasping]

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:27.124
This is the third time
this has happened to me!

00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:28.582
How could you?

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:29.624
Slap.

00:03:29.625 --> 00:03:32.291
[groans] Jessie, it's not what you think.

00:03:32.292 --> 00:03:35.124
Tell them, Buzz! Tell them about our love!

00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:37.207
But, Trixie, that was then...

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:39.833
...and this is now.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:41.499
[Bonnie] Protect the babies!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.041
You'll hear from my lawyers about this!

00:03:43.042 --> 00:03:44.707
- This is an outrage.
- Tell them, Buzz.

00:03:44.708 --> 00:03:47.583
- Congratulations.
- You got this, Deputy.

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:50.249
- So did you help?
- Yeah.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.124
We just followed Jessie's lead.

00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:54.332
- Woody, will you...
- Um...

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:56.833
- ...hold these? I'll drive.
- Well... [chuckles]

00:03:57.875 --> 00:03:59.000
Ooh, la la.

00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:02.375
[grunting]

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.082
- Yes! Oh, look at them.
- They're glowing.

00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:06.541
They're such good friends.

00:04:06.542 --> 00:04:07.874
Okay, save that one.

00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:09.291
- Fierce.
- Oh, my gosh. Yes!

00:04:09.292 --> 00:04:10.332
Okay, Buzz with the kilt.

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.291
[Bonnie] I'm moving to Palm Springs.

00:04:12.292 --> 00:04:14.082
[Blaze] What if Trixie
poisoned the wedding cake?

00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:17.708
- [Bonnie] But, Trixie, why?
- [cackling]

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.541
Hey, would you ever wanna sleep over?

00:04:20.542 --> 00:04:23.458
[gasps] Yes! That'd be so fun.

00:04:23.958 --> 00:04:25.083
Look. Look, look.

00:04:27.292 --> 00:04:29.416
<i>Friends forever, partner.</i>

00:04:29.417 --> 00:04:32.582
[Blaze] Come on, Jessie.
We'll take my spaceship.

00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:34.624
- Where to first?
- Neptune!

00:04:34.625 --> 00:04:35.832
What are you guys doing?

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:37.332
Honeymooning!

00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:38.416
Wanna come?

00:04:38.417 --> 00:04:40.999
- Sure!
- Wait, wait.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.499
Look, Jessie, space dolphins!

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.582
Hi, dolphin.

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:45.500
[♪ happy music playing]

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:02.708
[♪ "I Knew It, I Knew You" plays]

00:05:05.625 --> 00:05:07.791
[Taylor Swift] <i>♪ I knew you ♪</i>

00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:09.832
<i>♪ Through the daze
Of the blades of the grass ♪</i>

00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:11.082
<i>♪ In summer ♪</i>

00:05:11.083 --> 00:05:12.957
<i>♪ Parachutes ♪</i>

00:05:12.958 --> 00:05:15.332
<i>♪ For the free fall
Of being younger ♪</i>

00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:20.667
<i>♪ I memorized the sound
Of your bare footsteps ♪</i>

00:05:21.708 --> 00:05:24.041
<i>♪ Running wild ♪</i>

00:05:24.042 --> 00:05:25.750
<i>♪ It's been a long time ♪</i>

00:05:26.917 --> 00:05:31.125
<i>♪ Life has ways
Of leaving those days behind ♪</i>

00:05:31.917 --> 00:05:34.874
<i>♪ But seeing you tonight ♪</i>

00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:36.832
<i>♪ I remembered I loved you ♪</i>

00:05:36.833 --> 00:05:39.124
<i>♪ Came back when it mattered
I saw you ♪</i>

00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:41.666
<i>♪ Standing there
In the light of the window ♪</i>

00:05:41.667 --> 00:05:43.332
<i>♪ Wearing that same smile ♪</i>

00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:45.124
<i>♪ Man, it's been a while ♪</i>

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:46.875
<i>♪ But I knew it, I knew you ♪</i>

00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:51.208
<i>♪ I knew it, I knew you ♪</i>

00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:54.291
<i>♪ I knew you ♪</i>

00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:55.374
<i>♪ All your blues ♪</i>

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:57.541
<i>♪ Like a mood ring
Changing colors ♪</i>

00:05:57.542 --> 00:05:59.416
<i>♪ You did too ♪</i>

00:05:59.417 --> 00:06:01.582
<i>♪ There were times
We could fight like brothers ♪</i>

00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:06.291
<i>♪ I watched you drive
Around the bend ♪</i>

00:06:06.292 --> 00:06:08.832
<i>♪ For what
I thought would be ♪</i>

00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:12.167
<i>♪ The last time
I saw my friend ♪</i>

00:06:13.083 --> 00:06:16.082
<i>♪ But love has ways
Of bringing things back ♪</i>

00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:17.917
<i>♪ To life ♪</i>

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.207
<i>♪ All you said was hi ♪</i>

00:06:21.208 --> 00:06:23.291
<i>♪ And I remembered
I loved you ♪</i>

00:06:23.292 --> 00:06:25.749
<i>♪ Came back when it mattered
I saw you ♪</i>

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.124
<i>♪ Standing there
In the light of the window ♪</i>

00:06:28.125 --> 00:06:29.791
<i>♪ Wearing that same smile ♪</i>

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:31.541
<i>♪ Man, it's been a while ♪</i>

00:06:31.542 --> 00:06:33.624
<i>♪ But I knew it, I knew you ♪</i>

00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:35.167
<i>♪ I knew ♪</i>

00:06:36.292 --> 00:06:40.167
- <i>♪ I knew, I knew ♪</i>
- <i>♪ I knew it, I knew you ♪</i>

00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:44.000
- <i>♪ I knew, I knew ♪</i>
- <i>♪ I knew it, I knew you ♪</i>

